#: index.md:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create beautiful,<br/><span class=\"platform-line\">accessible<br/><span class=\"platform web\">web</span></span><br/>apps."
msgstr "Creu hardd,<br/><span class=\"platform-line\">hygyrch<br/><span class=\"platform web\">gwe</span></span><br/>apiau."

#: index.md:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr "Un model tocyn datrysiedig, wedi'i drawsffurfio i arddulliau, rhwymiadau fframwaith, cod frodorol, a chynnig offer dylunio."

#: index.md:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Dechrau"

#: index.md:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "Cyfeirlyfr CSS"

#: index.md:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Cyfeirlyfr API"

#: index.md:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "Un ffynhonnell o wirionedd"

#: index.md:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every packages uses the official Instructure design tokens, components, and interactions from <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."
msgstr "Mae pob pecyn yn defnyddio'r tocynau dylunio swyddogol Instructure, cydrannau, a rhyngweithiad o <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."

#: index.md:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Defnyddiwch y pecyn lleiaf"

#: index.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Install just <code>@pantoken/css</code> for a stylesheet, <code>@pantoken/pendo</code> for guides, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "Gosodwch dim ond @pantoken/css ar gyfer dalen arddull, @pantoken/react ar gyfer hooks ac eiconau, neu ragosodwr bundler ar gyfer Tailwind, Panda, neu MUI."

#: index.md:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Generiwch ar gyfer unrhyw lwyfan"

#: index.md:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install the pantoken cli to generate presets or add components for any platform&colon; web, native, and anything in between."
msgstr "Gosod y pantoken cli i gynhyrchu rhagosodiadau neu ychwanegu cydrannau ar gyfer unrhyw lwyfan&colon; gwe, brodorol, a pob dim arall."

#: index.md:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "No React needed"
msgstr "Dim React angen"

#: index.md:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "The InstUI library is tightly coupled with React. If you want to use it, you have to use React. Now you can build anywhere."
msgstr "Mae Llyfrgell InstUI wedi'i chysylltu'n dynn â React. Os ydych chi eisiau ei defnyddio, rhaid i chi ddefnyddio React. Nawr gallwch chi adeiladu yn unrhywle."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
#~ msgstr "InstUI, ym mhobman"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
#~ msgstr "Mae pob pecyn yn darllen yr un IR tocyn datrysiedig. Newidiwch docyn yn y ffynhonnell a llifo ef i CSS, SCSS, cod frodorol, a Figma yr un ffordd."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
#~ msgstr "Rhedwch `pantoken generate` i allforio Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, ac eraill. Yr un tocynnau, yn idiom pob ecosystem."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "No upstream coupling"
#~ msgstr "Dim cysylltiad uwchlaw"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
#~ msgstr "Mae'r tocynnau'n cael eu danfon wedi'u vendorio fel JSON statig, felly nid yw `npm i` byth yn cyrraedd at ffynhonnell sydd ond ar GitHub. Gallu ei gyhoeddi, gyda semver, ac yn gyfeillgar i weithredu heb gysylltiad."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "The package map"
#~ msgstr "Map pecynnau"
